					Each row is one modifier against its own base, so the
					difference is the thing being reviewed. A variant that
					computed identically to its base would be a class that
					looks right in this table and does nothing anywhere
					else.
				</p>

				<h3 class="cm-kicker cm-kicker--plain" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3)">tags</h3>
				<div class="cm-spec">
